<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">AGGAI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Aggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aggai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Agg</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AGGAI</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Aggai </char> obedo coc ma cegocego ma kicoyo malube ki lok me kwena pa Rwot ma lanebi Aggai otito. Loke obedo ikine ka mwaka miya abic ki pyere aryo ma pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikare meno onongo dong jo Icrael gudwogo cen i lobogi nia ki i lobo kama yam onongo kiyakogi ci kiterogi i opii ma onongo gurii kunu mada. Inge dwogogi paco gubedo gudike i lobo me Icrael, ento Ot pa Rwot Lubangagi onongo kireto woko piny.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok ma i buk man cuku cwiny lutela ki lwak me Icrael ducu me miine keken gi me gedo Ot pa Rwot, dok kitito pi cike pa Rwot me miyo kuc ki lonyo botgi pi ticgi ikare me anyim.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Twero me gedo Ot pa Rwot <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAG 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me kwena me kweyo cwiny ki miyo gen bot lwak <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAG 2:1-23">2:1-23</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ociko pi gero Ot pa Lubanga odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:24-5:2">Eji 4:24—5:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:14">6:14</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka me aryo me loc pa rwot Dario, inino dwe acel me dwe me abicel, Rwot obino ci oloko ki Aggai, lok ma en myero otit bot Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel, ma onongo tye laloc pa jo Juda, ki bene bot Yocwa wod pa Yekojadak.<verse eid="HAG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />Rwot me mony owaco bot Aggai kuman ni, “Rok man gibedo kawaco ni, kare peya oromo me gero Ot pa Rwot odoco.” <verse eid="HAG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Ci Rwot dok oloko ki lanebi Aggai, kun waco ni, <verse eid="HAG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" />“Wun jona, man mono aye kare ma omyero wun wubed i odiwu ma wugero wigi mabeconi, ma kun wuneno Oda obale woko? <verse eid="HAG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />Wun mono pe wutye kaneno gin matye katime botwu ikare man ikwowu? <verse eid="HAG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" />Wucoyo kodi madwong, ento wukayo manok; wucamo camwu, ento bene pe wuyeng; wumato matgu, ento pe romowu; dok wuruke, ento ngat mo ma kome bedo lyet bene peke; dok ngat ma camo mucara camo mucarane ento pe konye wa ki acel. <verse eid="HAG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />Kong wutam pi kit gin ducu matye katime i kwowu. <verse eid="HAG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" />Kombedi dong wucit iwi godi, wek wukel yadi me gedo, ci wuger ki Ot man, ci biyomo cwinya, dok kibiwora iye kit ma myero.<verse eid="HAG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />Wun wubedo kageno ni wubinongo cam mabup, ento wucoko manok mo. Dok ikare ma wukelo paco, amiyo orwenyo woko. Wun mono wutamo ikom gin ma omiyo man otime? Man otime pien Oda tye ma obale woko, kun ki tung botwu, ngat acel acel tye kabole abola katiyo tic me ode maber. <verse eid="HAG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo kot okwero cwer woko i lobowu ki toyo bene peke, dok lobo bene okwero ceko cam pirwu. <verse eid="HAG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" />An bene dong aciko ni can pii myero obed tye i lobo, ki ikom godi, ikom ngano, ikom kongo bwino manyen, ikom moo, ki ikom ginapita ducu ma gidongo i lobo, ikom dano, ki ikom dyangi, ki ikom ticgi ducu ma gitiyo.”<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano ducu gutiyo kit ma Rwot ociko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Meno omiyo Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel, kacel ki Yocwa wod pa Yekojadak, ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, ki jo ducu ma gudong, guwinyo lok pa Rwot Lubangagi, ki lok pa lanebi Aggai, kit macalo Rwot Lubangagi oore kwede; ci lwak gucako bedo kilworo inyim Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="HAG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" />Lacen Aggai dok otito kwena pa Rwot bot lwak ni, “An abibedo kwedwu, man aye acike iye botwu.” <verse eid="HAG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" />Ci Rwot otugu cwiny Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel, laloc me Juda, ki cwiny Yocwa wod pa Yekojadak, ajwaka madit, ki cwiny lwak ducu ma gudong; cut gubino ci gucako tic ikom Ot pa Rwot me mony, ma en aye Lubangagi. <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" />Gin gucako tic meno inino dwe pyere aryo wiye angwen me dwe me abicel ma en aye mwaka me aryo me loc pa rwot Dario.<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Deyo me Ot pa Lubanga ma kigero manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />I mwaka me aryo me loc pa rwot Dario, inino dwe pyere aryo wiye acel me dwe me abiro, Rwot obino ci oloko bot lanebi Aggai kuman ni, <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />“Tit bot Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel, laloc me Juda, ki bot Yocwa wod pa Yekojadak, ma en ajwaka madit, ki bot jo ducu ma gudong i lobo Icrael, kun iwaco ni, <verse eid="HAG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:12">Eji 3:12</ref></char></note>‘Gwok tye ngat mo ma pud odong ikinwu ma ceng oneno ot man ki deyone macon ba? Kombedi kong wunen deyone tye ningning? Pe nen ki iwangwu macalo gin ma konye peke?’ <verse eid="HAG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" />Kadi kumeno, in Jerubabel, kombedi omyero ibed ki tekcwiny, in kacel ki Yocwa, wod pa Yekojadak, ajwaka madit; ki wun jo ducu ma wubedo i loboni, wubed ki tekcwiny, wutii ticwu ducu, pien atye kwedwu, <verse eid="HAG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:45-46">Nia 29:45-46</ref></char></note>macalo ceng acike kwede kwedwu ikare ma wua ki i Ejipt. Cwiny mera bibedo ikinwu; pe wulwor.<verse eid="HAG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:26">Ibru 12:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dong odong kare manok mo keken, ci abiyengo polo ki lobo, nam ki ngom ma otwo. <verse eid="HAG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" />Dok abiyengo rok ducu, wek lonyo me rok ducu obin iye kany, ka dong abipongo Ot man ki deyo. <verse eid="HAG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" />Ryal ducu mera, jabu bene mera. <verse eid="HAG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />Ci dong deyo me Ot man ma lacen bikato mukwongo ca; dok abimiyo kabedo man bibedo ki kuc. Man an Rwot me mony aye awaco.”<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aggai openyo tam ki bot ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />I mwaka me aryo me loc pa Dario, inino dwe pyere aryo wiye angwen me dwe me abongwen, Rwot Matwero ducu dok oloko ki lanebi Aggai kun waco ni, <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" />“Peny ajwaki wek gugam peny man, <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />‘Kace dano mo otingo ringo ma kityero dok kilonyo odoko maleng, i dog bongone, ce dog bongonenu ogudu kwon, nyo dek, nyo kongo bwino, nyo moo, nyo kit cam mo keken, ci lonyo cam meno doko leng?’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:12">Ci ajwaki gugamo ni, “Pe kumeno.”<verse eid="HAG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 19:11-22">Wel 19:11-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Aggai dok openyogi ni, “Kace dano mo ma kome ki keni pien ogudu kom dano ma oto, ce en ogudu gin mo ikin jami magi, gin bene doko gin ma keni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:13">Ci ajwaki gudok iye ni, “Doko gin ma keni.”<verse eid="HAG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" />Aggai dok owaco ni, “Lok pa jo man ki lok pa rok matye inyima tye kitmeno, man lok pa Rwot kikome. Man bene mako tic cinggi ducu; dok gin ma gityero kunu gin ma keni.”<verse eid="HAG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocike me miyo gum bot lwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Kong wutam pi gin ma dong ocako time ma onongo peya kicako cano kidi iwi wadi me roco Ot pa Rwot, onongo yam kwowu obedo ningning? <verse eid="HAG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />Ikare meno ka kare me kacwu oromo ci odur kalwu kama onongo wutamo ni wubinongo iye kilo miya aryo, ento wunongo maromo kilo miya acel keken; dok ka ngat ma obino i bur kongo bwino pi twomo lita miya acel, nongo lita pyere angwen keken. <verse eid="HAG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" />Yam apwodowu, kun abwaro camwu, dok amiyo pee ogoyo tic cingwu ducu. Atimo kumeno; ento pe wumedo ki dwogo bota. <verse eid="HAG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" />Tin nino dwe pyere aryo wiye angwen me dwe me abongwen, ma en nino ma dong kityeko keto iye te guti me Ot pa Rwot. Dong wuket wangwu me neno gin ma dong bibedo katime. <verse eid="HAG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" />Kadi bed kodiwu pud peke i dero, wa olokwu, oduruwu, ki okwer pomegranat peya gucako nyak, cake tin cito kwede anyim, an dong abimiyowu gum.”<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocike bot Jerubabel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Inino meno kikome, inino dwe pyere aryo wiye angwen me dwe meno, Rwot dok oloko ki Aggai tyen me aryone kun waco ni, <verse eid="HAG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" />“Tit bot Jerubabel, laloc me Juda ni, dong acok cako yengo polo ki lobo, <verse eid="HAG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" />ci abituru rok mapol; dok acok tyeko teko me ker pa lurok mapol, ki abireto gadigadi lweny kacel ki jo ma ngweco kwedgi, aguragura ki wegigi, kun ngat acel acel bipoto piny ma nongo pala lucwan pa lawote aye nongo oneke. <verse eid="HAG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" />Ci inino meno, abitero in, Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ma latica, ci abiloko in ibedo macalo agit cinga ma kidiyo me lanyut, pien dong atyeko yero in woko.” Man lok pa an Rwot me mony kikome.<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>